      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792917092711,
      "created": 1792912000479,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "若无数据，就可将 TValue 填入。\nEntry 中 \nkey = TKey，\nvalue = TValue，\nnext = -1，\nhashCode = TKey转的哈希值",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "若无数据，就可将 TValue 填入。\nEntry 中 \nkey = TKey，\nvalue = TValue，\nnext = -1，\nhashCode = TKey转的哈希值",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jJLPvnHsXIz_Q_oHE5hLI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2208.3333740234375,
      "y": 1176.8333129882812,
      "width": 443.5999450683594,
      "height": 100,
