      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792917093257,
      "created": 1792912327993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "若有数据，判断 key 是否等于 TKey，\n若相等，即查询到结果，将该数据的 value 返回。\n若不相等，查看其 next，\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "若有数据，判断 key 是否等于 TKey，\n若相等，即查询到结果，将该数据的 value 返回。\n若不相等，查看其 next，\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YfwP1fJmUdNc2pW2pKEoK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2049,
      "y": 1403.5,
      "width": 475.2799377441406,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
